# Slice 8a · Meridian Foundation + Linia Bavaria Trading Line

*Multi-company demo data · intl_invoice template variant · Linia Bavaria authored end-to-end (HydroBayern DE supplier + AutoComp RO client) · intra-Meridian foundation · ~15 docs · multilingual (EN for foreign correspondence · RO for internal + RO clients) · public site unchanged · Atelier Nova still front-and-center*

---

## Why

Slice-7 made NovAI Desk demoable to a Romanian SME visitor. Slice-8 makes the *Ask My Company* demo real — but Ask only sings when there's enough corpus to ask interesting questions of. Meridian Comerț Internațional SRL — a 30-person industrial spare-parts trading firm with 3 named trading lines, foreign suppliers, RO clients, in-house legal, and an external accountant — is the archive that gives Ask something to find.

45 docs is heavy. We split:

- **slice-8a (this codon)** — multi-company schema · template extension for international invoices · the **Linia Bavaria** trading line end-to-end (HydroBayern GmbH supplier ↔ AutoComp Industries RO client) · intra-Meridian foundation docs (accounting · admin · one internal procedure) · ~15 docs total · the architectural foundation that 8b just adds content to
- **slice-8b** (coordinator writes after 8a ships) — Contract Anatolia (Anadolu Bearings TR) · Acord Suzhou (Suzhou Precision Tools CN) · ongoing suppliers (Officine Lombarde IT · ProTech Drives CN) · Romanian B2B clients for those lines (Moara Solca · Atelier Mecanic Iași) · legal opinions from SCA Marin & Asociații · remaining Diligent accounting docs · remaining intra-Meridian docs · ~30 docs

Meridian stays backstage on the public site this slice. The visitor experience is unchanged. Meridian docs exist in the DB, flow through the analyzer pipeline, and get indexed by DocumentIndexer — but `/app/inbox` continues to show only Atelier Nova. Slice-9 turns Meridian visible by wiring the guided Ask My Company experience.

Language rule for 8a:
- HydroBayern correspondence (invoices · order confirmations · emails) in **English** — international B2B trade reality
- AutoComp Industries correspondence (Meridian's RO client) in **Romanian**
- Intra-Meridian docs (Diligent emails · admin · internal procedures) in **Romanian**

This is one of the more interesting demo signals: a Romanian SME's archive is naturally multilingual, and Ask My Company should ground answers across both languages without flinching.

---

