## Resolved decisions (coordinator)

```
language mix              foreign supplier correspondence in EN · RO clients + intra-Meridian in RO
                          (taste call · 2026-05-11 · reflects international trade reality)

slice size                slice-8 split into 8a (foundation + Linia Bavaria · ~15 docs) and 8b
                          (remaining trading lines + clients + legal + admin · ~30 docs)
                          (2026-05-11 user decision · less builder fatigue · cleaner checkpoints)

public visibility         Meridian stays backstage in slice-8a AND slice-8b · /app/inbox shows only
                          Atelier Nova · /about gets a disclosure paragraph · slice-9 wires the
                          guided Ask My Company experience and that's where Meridian becomes
                          user-visible (2026-05-11)

company isolation         add Document.company enum column · backfill existing rows to "atelier_nova" ·
                          /app/inbox default filter company=atelier_nova · /app/ask searches all
                          (rationale: lets us seed both archives without /app/inbox getting muddled ·
                           keeps slice-9 Ask architecture simple — no second pipeline)

trading line tracking     Document.trading_line nullable string · populated from YAML meta.trading_line ·
                          used by slice-9 guided-question grouping · null for Atelier Nova + intra-Meridian
                          (rationale: simpler than a separate trading_lines table for ~3 distinct values ·
                           promote to a table if we ever have many lines or need attributes)

template extension        intl_invoice.html new template (extends invoice.html semantics · adds
                          currency · incoterms · customs ref · EN labels) · contract template REUSED
                          for both EN and RO contracts via meta.language driving label set
                          (rationale: minimize template proliferation · keep editing surface small)

YAML schema growth        meta.language · meta.trading_line · meta.currency · meta.incoterms
                          (back-compat: missing = defaults — language="ro" · trading_line=null ·
                          currency="RON" · incoterms=null)

intra-Meridian docs       5 docs total in 8a · exercise classifier categories internal_procedure +
                          hr_document for the first time in committed content (slice-4 had them in
                          the enum but no docs to verify against)
                          (rationale: surfaces classifier behavior on these labels before 8b doubles down)

trading_line in URL/UI    NOT in 8a · slice-9 owns the UI surface that filters by trading_line
                          GET /api/documents?company=meridian acceptable for builder/eval only

new counterparties        none expected in 8a · companies.synthetic.hybrid already lists HydroBayern +
                          AutoComp · all other 8a docs are intra-Meridian (Diligent · Roxana ·
                          Mihai Stoica · Andrei Vasilescu — all in companies.synthetic Meridian block)
                          if builder finds a gap: add to companies.synthetic FIRST with ONRC check
```

